---
# QQPY.CandFix 代码风格
#
# 与现有代码保持一致：Allman 大括号、4 空格缩进、指针/引用符号左置。
# SortIncludes 必须保持 false：<windows.h> 必须在 <atlbase.h> / <msctf.h> 之前，
# 否则 combaseapi.h 会先声明 DllGetClassObject（C2375 different linkage）。
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Microsoft

IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
ColumnLimit: 120

BreakBeforeBraces: Allman
AccessModifierOffset: -4    # public:/private: 与 class 的 { 对齐（顶格）
PointerAlignment: Left
ReferenceAlignment: Pointer

AlignConsecutiveAssignments: Consecutive
AlignConsecutiveDeclarations: Consecutive

AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Inline
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: WithoutElse
AllowShortBlocksOnASingleLine: Always
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false

SortIncludes: false
IncludeBlocks: Preserve

SpacesBeforeTrailingComments: 2
MaxEmptyLinesToKeep: 1
